      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should frame your podcast around the urgent, non-negotiable need to reclaim national sovereignty by prioritizing strict border security and rejecting the dilution of our identity through globalist policies. Your show must clearly articulate that true independence requires protecting our borders and making sovereign decisions without external pressure, as these are the only ways to preserve our culture and safety. By centering the narrative on the tangible threats posed to our nation's security and the moral imperative to stand firm against these forces, you will resonate deeply with citizens who feel their country is being sacrificed for abstract global ideals.",
      "source": "target",
